/*!
\page page_stxivertex StXiVertex

\brief Vertex representing a cascade (Xi or Omega) decay: bachelor track plus associated V0.

\section stxivertex_overview Overview
StXiVertex reconstructs the secondary decay vertex of multi-strange baryons
(Ξ⁻→Λπ⁻, Ω⁻→ΛK⁻, and charge conjugates).  It stores the bachelor track
link, its momentum at the Xi vertex, DCA quantities, and a link to the
associated StV0Vertex (the Λ decay vertex).

Xi vertices are stored in StEvent::xiVertices().

\section stxivertex_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code{.cpp}
TObject → StObject → StMeasuredPoint → StVertex → StXiVertex
\endcode

\section stxivertex_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mDaughter | StLink<StTrack> | Non-owning link to the bachelor track. |
| mDcaBachelorToPrimaryVertex | Float_t | Bachelor DCA to PV (cm). |
| mMomentumOfBachelor | StThreeVectorF | Bachelor momentum at Xi vertex (GeV/c). |
| mDcaDaughters | Float_t | Bachelor–V0 DCA at Xi vertex (cm). |
| mDcaParentToPrimaryVertex | Float_t | Xi DCA to PV (cm). |
| mV0Vertex | StLink<StV0Vertex> | Non-owning link to the V0 decay vertex. |

\section stxivertex_methods Key Methods

\code{.cpp}
const StSPtrVecXiVertex& xis = event->xiVertices();
for (size_t i = 0; i < xis.size(); ++i) {
    const StXiVertex* xi = xis[i];
    if (xi->dcaDaughters() > 0.5) continue;
    const StV0Vertex*    v0 = xi->v0Vertex();
    StThreeVectorF pBach    = xi->momentumOfBachelor();
    StThreeVectorF pTotal   = xi->momentum();
    // compute Xi invariant mass under Lambda+pion hypothesis
}
\endcode

\sa \ref page_stvertex, \ref page_stv0vertex
*/
